  "body": "• A rare northeast facing 2063sqm (more or less) site in the Mixed Housing Suburban Zone providing a huge opportunity for extensive development\r\n• Approved Resource Consent granted for 15 townhouses\r\n• A lapsed building consent can be provided upon request. 7 of the townhouses offer three bedrooms, three bathrooms, and a single-car garage, with approximate floor areas ranging from 145 sqm to 167 sqm. The remaining 8 townhouses feature four bedrooms, three bathrooms, and a single-car garage, with approximate floor areas between 161 sqm and 188 sqm\r\n• Great sea views from the ground level and easy access to the Stormwater and Wastewater manholes\r\n• Only a few minutes (approx.) drive to the Long Bay Primary, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n• A few minutes (approx.) drive to Long Bay Beach and Torbay Medical Centre\r\n\r\n• Only a few minutes (approx.) drive to modern Long Bay Village, traditional Torbay Village, cafes, restaurants and supermarket\r\n\r\n• Easy proximity to motorway, Park & Ride, public transport and 10 mins (approx.) drive to Albany Shopping Centre and Massey University\r\n\r\n•Perfect for developers, smart investors or just keep it as a land bank",
